        "content": "<p>macovedj opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14490\">PR #14490</a> from <code>macovedj:subtask-cancel-lifetime</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A guest can request asynchronous cancellation and then attempt to drop<br>\nthe subtask before cancellation finishes. Previously, <code>subtask.cancel</code><br>\nimmediately marked the host task as done, allowing that drop even when<br>\ncancellation returned <code>BLOCKED</code>.</p>\n<p>This can remove a task entry that the completion worker still references.<br>\nIf another host call reuses the slot, the old completion can report<br>\n<code>RETURN_CANCELLED</code> for the new task, even though it was never cancelled.</p>\n<p>This PR introduces <code>CalleeCancelling</code> to preserve the task entry while completion<br>\nprocessing is pending and rejects <code>subtask.drop</code> until that processing has<br>\nfinished and the terminal event has been delivered.</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 628736583,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1790961843
    },
